title: restsite_normal
---
<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>>
<<wait 1>>
<<picture YarnCommands restsite>>
<<fade_in YarnCommands 1>>
<<bloom_text YarnCommands "Place of Respite">>
You have found a safe place. For now, no harm can reach you here.
What will you do? 
-> Rest <<if not is_full_health()>> #paneldetails=Heal_40%_Health
    <<change_health_percent 40>>
    You take advantage of the tranquility and allow yourself to rest. Your journey is still far from over, after all.
    <<jump rest_end>>
-> Pray <<if light() < 100>> #paneldetails=Gain_10_Light
    <<change_light 10>>
    You fall to your knees and begin to pray. You ask for the strength to endure whatever ordeals still await you.
    As you pray, you begin to feel something stir within you.
    When you finish, you notice that the lantern has begun to glow brighter.
    <<jump rest_end>>
-> Ponder #paneldetails=Gain_1_Insight
    <<change_insight 1>>
    You sit down and take a moment to reminisce about life.
    In the quiet of your mind, a clearer understanding takes shape.
    <<jump rest_end>>
-> Train #paneldetails=Gain_2_Proficiency
    <<change_proficiency 2>>
    The dangers of this world will only grow stronger. You decide to hone your skills and prepare yourself for what lies ahead.
    <<jump rest_end>>
===


title: rest_end
---
<<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>>
<<wait 1>>
<<fade_out YarnCommands 2>>
<<load_map_scene>>
===